Advertised at resolve-component-paths.py:14 (usage text) and
specs/epic-191-a3-path-ownership/design.md:444 (API / Contract Plan).
design.md is frozen and hash-bound, so removing the flag from the advertised
API would need the provenance re-review path. Implementing was chosen instead:
JSON is already the unconditional output of every mode in both runtimes and
neither has an alternative format, so the flag is a pure accept-and-ignore.

